772	     * {@code REGION} is the region the owner's identity derives to from its postcode (falling back to
773	     * the city table when the postcode is absent or in no known range) and {@code HASH8} is the first
774	     * eight upper-case hex characters of the SHA-256 digest of the normalized telephone concatenated
775	     * with the last name (e.g. {@code 'NSW-1A2B3C4D'}). The telephone has already been normalized to
776	     * E.164 form by {@link #normalizeTelephone}. There is no per-city sequence: the identity is a
777	     * pure function of region, telephone and last name.
